7. Conclusion

This thesis has presented MCD v0.6.1 as a corrective formulation of the MCD program. The corrections are concentrated where the statistical foundations required them.

The center-outward distribution and quantile functions are defined via optimal transport, with Q_P^{\pm}{}_{\#}U_d = P and F_P^{\pm}{}_{\#}P = U_d. The q-dominance relation is defined as Q_P^{\pm}(F_Q^{\pm}(y)) \geq y, adopted from van der Laag et al. (2026) by reference rather than asserted independently. The conditional nesting of stochastic dominance and Pareto expansion is formulated as a compatibility assumption rather than a theorem. The equivalence between log-loss utility and negative KL divergence under matched information is stated with correct weighted notation. The research questions are separated into RQ1 (Value of Causal Information) and RQ2 (matched-information metareasoning). Gatekeeping control is specified for the nested hypotheses. H_{1a} is formulated as a population-level claim with a well-defined violation functional. The q-dominance test recognizes the incomplete outcome. The leakage audit uses multiple probes with a pre-registered diagnostic threshold. The hierarchical model is paired. The energy measurement is defined as a time integral of power over a boundary, not as an accounting decomposition. The nomenclature reflects that the metric measures interventional predictive adequacy conditional on supplied intervention semantics, not causal discovery capability.

The program remains falsifiable in multiple directions. It can produce

\mathrm{MCD} \approx B_{\text{matched}},
\tag{7.1}

confirming that the sought difference was algebraically empty. It can produce

\mathrm{MCD} \not\approx B_{\text{matched}},
\tag{7.2}

revealing a genuine computational policy effect. It can produce

\text{no Pareto expansion},
\tag{7.3}

killing the hypothesis. Or it can produce

\text{Pareto expansion without } q\text{-dominance},
\tag{7.4}

showing that the gain is local rather than distributional.

If MCD fails, the result is: within the defined protocol, on the studied SCM families and budgets, no detectable improvement according to the pre-registered criteria was obtained. If MCD succeeds, then — and only then — the question "why does this structure emerge?" becomes scientific.

In either case, the thesis produces something more valuable than a beautiful equation: a device that makes victory costly even for the one who writes it. This is the only criterion that distinguishes a research program from a beautiful verbal construction.


